{"step_index":672,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T20:30:02Z","thinking":"**Initiating API Endpoint Verification**\n\nStarting to validate the API endpoints using a scripted approach, ensuring the server's operational stability. The script will sequentially check the health endpoint, customer login with provided credentials, history retrieval (all, purchases, and verifications), digital receipt retrieval based on a specific receipt ID, and direct customer purchase order submission. This comprehensive testing will confirm API functionality.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"powershell -Command \"\n\\$loginRes = Invoke-RestMethod -Uri 'http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login' -Method Post -ContentType 'application/json' -Body '{\\\"email\\\":\\\"customer@gmail.com\\\",\\\"password\\\":\\\"Customer@123\\\"}';\nWrite-Host 'Login status:' \\$loginRes.success 'User:' \\$loginRes.user.name;\n\\$token = \\$loginRes.token;\n\n\\$headers = @{ 'Authorization' = 'Bearer ' + \\$token };\n\\$histAll = Invoke-RestMethod -Uri 'http://localhost:5000/api/history' -Headers \\$headers;\nWrite-Host 'Total History records:' \\$histAll.count;\n\n\\$histPurchases = Invoke-RestMethod -Uri 'http://localhost:5000/api/history?type=PURCHASE' -Headers \\$headers;\nWrite-Host 'Purchase records:' \\$histPurchases.count;\n\n\\$histVerif = Invoke-RestMethod -Uri 'http://localhost:5000/api/history?type=VERIFICATION' -Headers \\$headers;\nWrite-Host 'Verification records:' \\$histVerif.count;\n\n\\$receiptRes = Invoke-RestMethod -Uri 'http://localhost:5000/api/sales/receipt/MC-2026-784102';\nWrite-Host 'Receipt MC-2026-784102 found:' \\$receiptRes.success 'Pharmacy:' \\$receiptRes.data.pharmacyId.name;\n\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\medcheck-bd","IsDaemon":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":10000,"toolAction":"Testing APIs","toolSummary":"Test login, history, and receipt retrieval"}}]}
